                                <td><svg class="svg-icon tdt-yes" viewBox="0 0 448 512" role="img" aria-label="Yes" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M438.6 105.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-256 256c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0L160 338.7 393.4 105.4c12.5-12.5 32.8-12.5 45.3 0z" /></svg></td>
